   "id": "yb-5-2-approach",
   "h": "Algorithm: Tall stature",
   "html": "<div class=\"flow\" data-flow=\"y52a\"></div><p><b>Tall stature</b> = Height &gt; 98<sup>th</sup> percentile (adult Male &gt; 180 cm, adult Female &gt; 167 cm)</p><ul><li>ประเมิน น้ำหนัก, pubertal staging, arm span และ Target height = MPH ± 7</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "id": "yb-5-2-normal",
   "h": "Variation of normal growth",
   "html": "<ul><li>Familial tall stature</li><li>Simple obesity</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "id": "yb-5-2-primary",
   "h": "Primary growth disorder",
   "html": "<ul><li><b>Sex chromosome disorder</b>: Klinefelter syndrome (XXY), XYY, XXX</li><li><b>Overgrowth syndrome</b>: Sotos syndrome, Beckwith-Weidemann syndrome, Weaver syndrome</li><li><b>Syndrome with tall stature</b>: Marfan syndrome, Homocystinuria, MEN 2B</li></ul>"
  },
  {
   "id": "yb-5-2-secondary",
   "h": "Secondary growth disorder (Endocrinopathy)",
   "html": "<ul><li><b>Growth hormone excess</b>: Giantism</li><li><b>Hypogonadism</b>: Hypogonadotrophic hypogonadism, Sex hormone def., Estrogen resistance</li><li><b>Hyperandrogenism</b>: Congenital Adrenal Hyperplasia, Adrenal tumor, Familial glucocorticoid deficiency</li><li><b>Hyperthyroidism</b></li><li><b>Precocious puberty (in adolescent)</b> — ดูกล่องย่อยด้านล่าง</li></ul>",
   "sub": [
    {
     "id": "yb-5-2-precocious",
     "h": "Precocious puberty (in adolescent)",
     "html": "<ul><li><b>Gonadotropin dependent</b>: Idiopathic, CNS abnormality</li><li><b>Gonadotropin independent</b>: Functional ovarian cyst (include McCune-Albright syndrome), Testotoxicosis, Testicular tumor, Longstanding hypothyroidism</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  }
 ],
